Edit: @anmorgunov I found the issue, we don't have any timeout for symbol lookups and the python lsp is either taking too long or has some bug, there also doesn't seem to be any debounce setup properly here so if this is really painful you can use the following as a work around for now but I hope to have this better addressed soon.

Put in your opencode.json:
```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "lsp": {
    "pyright": {
      "disabled": true
    }
  }
}
```
